 "title": "Adjust Payrate for Raises in RTI/XBO (Guides for Both)",
 "description": "This guide provides step-by-step instructions on how to adjust pay rates for raises in both RTI and XBO systems. It emphasizes the importance of following the steps accurately to avoid deactivating time card numbers. The guide covers specific actions for each system, including logging in, navigating to the relevant sections, adding new pay rates, deleting old ones, and removing deactivation dates. By following this guide, users can effectively and correctly adjust pay rates for raises in RTI and XBO systems.",
 "section": "Office ScribeHows",
 "subsection": "XBO/RTI (All guides are using XBO unless specified)",
 "pdf": "pdfs/Office ScribeHows/XBO-RTI/Adjust Payrate for Raises in RTI-XBO (Guides for Both).pdf",
